pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$paper"
notes: "演讲者备注：第八页聚焦直采贸易溢价与高山农林复合生态体系。通过对真实咖啡期货C-Market价格（ICO 2023数据：1.75美元/磅）与北纬三十度直采地头交货价（3.40美元/磅）的对比，论证94%溢价直达咖农如何从根本上激励极致手工采摘与生物多样性保护。"
elements:
  # Fixed top-left section marker
  - elementId: section-marker
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 32, 6, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$klein"

  - elementId: section-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [78, 32, 400, 24]
    content:
      style: "$sectionNum"
      text: "08 // DIRECT TRADE & SUSTAINABLE HARVEST"

  - elementId: top-meta-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [768, 32, 448, 24]
    content:
      style: "$meta"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: "30°N ROASTERY // SUSTAINABILITY AUDIT // 示例品牌（虚构）"

  - elementId: top-divider
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 68, 1152, 0]
    points: "0,0 1152,0"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 0.5
      color: "$gridLine"

  # Heavy rule above headline
  - elementId: headline-rule
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 95, 1152, 0]
    points: "0,0 1152,0"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 4
      color: "$ink"

  - elementId: page-headline
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 110, 1152, 45]
    content:
      style: "$headline"
      text: "94%直采地头溢价：以经济正义保障高山极境的生态续航"

  # Left 7 columns (x: 64, w: 640): Direct trade economic analysis & Custom SVG path shape
  - elementId: trade-lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 166, 640, 92]
    content:
      fontFamily: "PingFang SC"
      fontSize: 15
      lineHeight: 1.6
      color: "$ink"
      text: |
        <p><strong>剔除中间商链路的透明定价体系</strong>：</p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px;">高山极境的采收成本是平原机械化农场的3.2倍。北纬三十度绕过传统生豆出口中介，采用完全透明的产地地头直采协议（Direct Farmgate Contract），以几乎翻倍的采购价格反哺高山守护者。</p>

  # Reused custom SVG path shape: 30°N Topographic wave contour
  - elementId: reused-topo-wave
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 268, 640, 45]
    shapeName: custom
    viewBox: [1000, 200]
    path: "M0,100 C150,20 300,180 500,100 C700,20 850,180 1000,100 L1000,200 L0,200 Z"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$klein"

  # Economic data columns (2-col within left 7 columns)
  - elementId: price-comp-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 320, 300, 150]
    content:
      fontFamily: "PingFang SC"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.55
      color: "$ink"
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:32px; color:$ink; font-weight:bold; font-family:'Arial Black';">$1.75</span> <span style="font-size:12px; color:$muted;">/ 磅 (lb)</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px; font-weight:bold; color:$muted;">ICO纽约期货基准价格（C-Market）</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px; font-size:12px;">全球商业咖啡大宗商品均价，难以覆盖高山手工精选采收的实际人工劳作成本。</p>

  - elementId: price-comp-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [404, 320, 300, 150]
    content:
      fontFamily: "PingFang SC"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.55
      color: "$ink"
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:32px; color:$klein; font-weight:bold; font-family:'Arial Black';">$3.40</span> <span style="font-size:12px; color:$muted;">/ 磅 (lb)</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px; font-weight:bold; color:$klein;">30°N 产地地头保底直采价（+94%）</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px; font-size:12px;">锁定高海拔微批次专属收购权，溢价的40%专项用于农户改良发酵遮阳棚架与雨水收集池。</p>

  - elementId: trade-sep
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 480, 640, 0]
    points: "0,0 640,0"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 0.5
      color: "$gridLine"

  - elementId: eco-commitments
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 495, 640, 110]
    content:
      fontFamily: "PingFang SC"
      fontSize: 13
      lineHeight: 1.6
      color: "$ink"
      text: |
        <p><strong>三项可持续生态种植承诺</strong>：</p>
        <p style="margin-top:4px;">1. <strong>100% 原始林冠荫蔽种植</strong>：保留天然云南樟树与核桃林，遮阴度保持在40%-50%，维护鸟类迁徙走廊；</p>
        <p>2. <strong>零化学除草剂使用</strong>：采用人工除草并全量原位覆盖堆肥，土壤有机质含量维持在4.5%以上；</p>
        <p>3. <strong>全封闭水循环处理</strong>：发酵淋洗水经多级生物砂滤与人工湿地净化，中水回用率达90%以上。</p>

  # Right 5 columns (x: 736, w: 480): Image with opacity
  - elementId: harvest-img
    elementType: image
    bounds: [736, 175, 480, 420]
    src: "assets/harvest_landscape.jpg"
    fit:
      mode: cover
    opacity: 0.82
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1.5
      color: "$ink"

  - elementId: harvest-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [736, 605, 480, 36]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      text: "PLATE 08.1 // 高山农林复合种植系统全景航测 // 30°N产地纪实（透明度82%）"

  # Baseline metadata & source
  - elementId: bottom-divider
    elementType: line
    bounds: [64, 650, 1152, 0]
    points: "0,0 1152,0"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 0.5
      color: "$gridLine"

  - elementId: bottom-info
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 665, 1152, 24]
    content:
      style: "$footer"
      text: "PAGE 08 // 30°N BRAND BOOK // ETHICAL TRADE & AGROFORESTRY // 示例品牌（虚构） // ICO BENCHMARK 2023"
